  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ifedinma Cassava Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cooperative will establish a cassava processing facility, which will use standard cassava processing machinery capable of producing fine grain garri and starch. They will also hire a business manager, accountant, agronomy consultant, and marketing staff member, undergoing training in business and financial management before developing a 5 year business plan.</narrative>
  </description>
